{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-4fc1e7a1f9adaef81c90a3297c7494878ed3b824f4b0bd7c","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"90c30effa297337d0ade78f19fe1b3b17f2da5b43e10f87db88e8fa3a9a30d33","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 45 (Loaded Displacement)\nThe loaded displacement of a ship when persons or cargo are loaded until the reference draught line is reached in water of specific gravity 1.025 (hereinafter in this Article referred to as the \"loaded condition\") shall be calculated by the following formula:\n\nV_D × (1/1,000) ρ\n\nV_D: Displacement volume of the ship in the loaded condition (cubic metres).\nρ: Density of seawater (kilograms per cubic metre).\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-45.json","sha256":"a4d607ff036e0cfe571a64c3ae979375422d4adbb2d4b0a4b0e54e7e5e81a25a"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_